00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:32,600
The move for this round

556
00:17:32,600 --> 00:17:33,920
is leg sweep dance.

557
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:34,640
Like this.

558
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:35,880
Like you did?

559
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:36,840
(Flamboyant)
Just like this.

560
00:17:36,840 --> 00:17:37,480
Like you did?

561
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:39,480
Let's go.

562
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:42,120
What are those four doing?

563
00:17:42,808 --> 00:17:43,898
(Windshield wipers x4)

564
00:17:45,211 --> 00:17:48,066
♪On the banyan tree by the pond♪

565
00:17:48,066 --> 00:17:50,171
♪Cicadas are singing♪

566
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:54,320
What do you mean?

567
00:17:54,320 --> 00:17:54,720
What's wrong?

568
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:56,080
What's up?

569
00:17:57,178 --> 00:18:00,068
(On the banyan tree by the pond)
♪Under the banyan tree by the pond♪

570
00:18:00,099 --> 00:18:02,131
♪Cicadas are singing♪

571
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:05,040
(Directionally challenged)
On the banyan tree.

572
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:05,320
On.

573
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,080
Are you cold?

574
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:07,840
(Belated care)
No, I'm good.

575
00:18:08,080 --> 00:18:08,800
Don't feel cold later.

576
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:11,680
We know deep down

577
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:13,000
we're going to lose miserably,

578
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,040
but let's have fun first.

579
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:14,800
(Doing the dirty deed beforehand)
Yes.

580
00:18:14,800 --> 00:18:15,880
(Just you wait)
Okay, no problem.

581
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:17,400
On!

582
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:17,800
On!

583
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:18,040
Come on.

584
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:19,160
On!

585
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:19,680
On!

586
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:20,360
What are we dancing now?

587
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:20,880
Hurry up.

588
00:18:21,760 --> 00:18:22,080
Alright.

589
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:25,048
Hold the neck.

590
00:18:25,048 --> 00:18:27,920
♪On the banyan tree by the pond♪

591
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:31,360
♪Cicadas are singing of summer♪

592
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:32,520
- Lin Yi.
- Lin Yi lost his voice.

593
00:18:32,520 --> 00:18:33,080
Lin Yi.

594
00:18:33,210 --> 00:18:36,128
♪On the swing by the playground♪

595
00:18:36,128 --> 00:18:40,125
(High harmony)
♪Only butterflies rest upon it♪

596
00:18:40,830 --> 00:18:41,119
Jun.

597
00:18:41,119 --> 00:18:43,844
♪Teacher's chalk on the blackboard♪

598
00:18:43,844 --> 00:18:47,873
♪Still chattering
and scribbling nonstop♪

599
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,348
Xingxu, sing.

600
00:18:49,348 --> 00:18:52,458
(Waiting for class to end)
♪Waiting for school to dismiss, waiting♪

601
00:18:52,458 --> 00:18:53,240
(Waiting for school to dismiss)
Class to end!

602
00:18:58,197 --> 00:18:58,640
Waiting...

603
00:18:59,394 --> 00:19:00,837
(Reacted so quickly
during water-splashing)

604
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:01,280
Wait.

605
00:19:01,280 --> 00:19:01,800
Wait, hold on a second.

606
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:02,760
Let's do a cheer, okay?

607
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:03,320
(Desperate for confidence)
Okay.

608
00:19:03,320 --> 00:19:03,680
Come on.

609
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:05,240
- Come on. Let's huddle.
- Come on. Let's huddle.

610
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,720
- Hands in.
- Hands in.

611
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:08,000
- One, two, three.
- One, two, three.

612
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:08,840
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

613
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:11,120
Try not to splash the face.

614
00:19:11,120 --> 00:19:11,640
No.

615
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:12,200
Aim straight for the face.

616
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:14,720
Come on.

617
00:19:16,560 --> 00:19:17,800
Come on. I can't handle mic stands.

618
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:18,160
Come on.

619
00:19:18,461 --> 00:19:19,520
(That was just a gear glitch)

620
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:20,760
Can't handle mic stands...

621
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:22,000
(Round two)
What's the move?

622
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:23,680
Like this.

623
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:27,200
♪On the banyan tree by the pond♪

624
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:31,080
♪Cicadas are singing of summer♪

625
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:35,120
♪Teacher's chalk on♪

626
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:43,120
(Stay calm)
It's okay.

627
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:43,760
(Hanging in there)
No problem.

628
00:19:44,186 --> 00:19:45,522
(Try again)

629
00:19:45,522 --> 00:19:47,156
♪Wel... Welfare♪

630
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:55,760
Alright, we'll definitely get it
this time.

631
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:57,680
- Last shot.
- Last shot.

632
00:19:57,880 --> 00:20:00,760
(Another attempt)
♪That girl from the neighboring class♪

633
00:20:00,760 --> 00:20:05,120
♪Why hasn't she passed by my window♪

634
00:20:06,149 --> 00:20:08,104
(Snacks in mouth)
♪Comics in pocket♪

635
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:12,320
What's the line again?

636
00:20:12,320 --> 00:20:13,200
Snacks in the mouth,

637
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:14,000
comics in hand.

638
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:15,840
(Laughing like a villain)

639
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:16,560
Come on.

640
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,080
(Plunge himself)
Plunge! Plunge yourself!

641
00:20:19,840 --> 00:20:21,200
Switch it up.

642
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:22,280
Yeah, pick someone else.

643
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:24,114
Pick someone else? Does it make sense?

644
00:20:24,328 --> 00:20:25,493
(Addicted to splashing)

645
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:26,680
We're just here to get soaked,

646
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:27,480
anyway.

647
00:20:27,680 --> 00:20:28,720
Take turns singing this time.

648
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:30,800
Don't all sing together right away.

649
00:20:30,800 --> 00:20:32,120
Call on Yuning first. He knows it.

650
00:20:32,120 --> 00:20:33,200
Just have him do it.

651
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,680
And after that, well...

652
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:34,960
Yeah.

653
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:36,240
Shattered.

654
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:37,240
Totally shattered.

655
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:38,000
I can't take this.

656
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:39,480
Come on. Music.

657
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:40,000
Dance move.

658
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:41,200
Put both hands here.

659
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,480
Like that Third Kiss Mark move.

660
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:44,800
(Sis, who are you?)
Third Kiss Mark?

661
00:20:44,800 --> 00:20:46,280
Where did you learn all these things?

662
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:47,320
What does that mean? I don't get it.

663
00:20:47,320 --> 00:20:47,760
Wave.

664
00:20:47,760 --> 00:20:49,080
Just a simple wave.

665
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:51,440
- I didn't even make you jump.
- Give us a harder one.

666
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:53,000
Your head's already crushed
from all the water.

667
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:53,840
Stop talking.

668
00:20:54,050 --> 00:20:55,856
(Hairstyle ruined)

669
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:57,840
And you still want a harder one?

670
00:20:57,840 --> 00:20:59,680
Unbelievable.

671
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:01,000
A true man of steel.

672
00:21:05,040 --> 00:21:05,520
I think...

673
00:21:05,520 --> 00:21:06,080
Here's what we do.

674
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:10,520
We splash whenever we want.

675
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:11,600
(Raising the stakes)
If we splash by mistake,

676
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,240
we get splashed in return.

677
00:21:13,360 --> 00:21:14,280
Fei, get back here.

678
00:21:15,040 --> 00:21:15,360
Okay.

679
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:16,240
Come back.

680
00:21:16,365 --> 00:21:16,900
(Always up to no good)
Okay.

681
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:18,800
Go cool off in the bucket.

682
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:21,367
(Want a scoop?)

683
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:24,560
(I have a plan)
Let's all stand behind.

684
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:26,280
- Just like that game.
- Yeah.

685
00:21:26,280 --> 00:21:27,064
(Water-splashing scene at Maori Village)

686
00:21:27,320 --> 00:21:28,720
We'll stand behind.

687
00:21:28,934 --> 00:21:29,554
(Playing for thrills)

688
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:36,360
Whoever I tap sings.

689
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:36,640
Right.

690
00:21:37,031 --> 00:21:38,553
(Teacher is calling roll)

691
00:21:48,560 --> 00:21:49,680
This is so tense.

692
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:50,560
Even looking at him makes me nervous.

693
00:21:55,040 --> 00:21:57,680
♪On the banyan tree by the pond♪

694
00:21:58,160 --> 00:21:59,280
No singing unless tapped!

695
00:21:59,532 --> 00:22:00,480
♪On the banyan tree♪

696
00:22:03,360 --> 00:22:04,200
Freaked him out.

697
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:05,080
Scared him half to death.

698
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:07,720
Wait,

699
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:08,595
if you aren't tapped, don't sing.

700
00:22:08,595 --> 00:22:10,000
- Don't sing unless tapped.
- I'll tell you

701
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:10,960
when to sing together.

702
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:11,760
No.

703
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:12,760
After the first line.

704
00:22:12,760 --> 00:22:13,400
After the first line.

705
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:13,920
- Because...
- No.

706
00:22:14,640 --> 00:22:15,400
I'm the teacher.

707
00:22:16,360 --> 00:22:17,040
(Questioning my authority)
I'm the teacher.

708
00:22:17,040 --> 00:22:17,920
Okay.

709
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:19,760
Come on.

710
00:22:19,760 --> 00:22:20,565
Stand properly.

711
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:24,400
Sing or not?

712
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:25,040
Don't sing.

713
00:22:25,040 --> 00:22:25,480
(Big mouth)
Don't ask.

714
00:22:28,698 --> 00:22:29,520
(Called on)

715
00:22:29,520 --> 00:22:31,480
One, two, three, four,

716
00:22:32,012 --> 00:22:33,720
- six, seven, sing!
- ♪Pond♪

717
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:36,564
♪On the banyan tree by the pond♪

718
00:22:36,564 --> 00:22:39,887
(Called on)
♪Cicadas are singing of summer♪

719
00:22:40,775 --> 00:22:41,588
(Getting back on beat)

720
00:22:41,588 --> 00:22:42,346
(Look at you)

721
00:22:42,346 --> 00:22:45,873
(Only butterflies rest upon it)
♪On the swing by the playground, cicada♪

722
00:22:48,600 --> 00:22:49,000
Wait a second.

723
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:49,960
Who did you tap?

724
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:50,760
He tapped me. Why...

725
00:22:50,760 --> 00:22:52,080
None of your business!

726
00:22:52,080 --> 00:22:53,360
None of your business!

727
00:22:56,160 --> 00:22:57,052
Mind your own business.

728
00:23:00,320 --> 00:23:01,509
Done for.

729
00:23:01,760 --> 00:23:02,520
So brutal.

730
00:23:02,800 --> 00:23:03,956
Brutal my foot.

731
00:23:03,978 --> 00:23:04,705
Okay...

732
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:09,920
Okay!

733
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,320
What goes around comes around.

734
00:23:11,320 --> 00:23:12,920
Nobody escapes karma.

735
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:13,746
(Build up first, then strike)

736
00:23:17,320 --> 00:23:17,960
Wait.

737
00:23:18,720 --> 00:23:18,920
No.

738
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:20,063
(Feeding Xingxu peanuts)
We didn't know who he tapped.

739
00:23:20,063 --> 00:23:21,280
What do you mean, wait?

740
00:23:24,199 --> 00:23:26,090
(Extra damage)

741
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:32,160
We didn't know who he tapped.

742
00:23:32,160 --> 00:23:33,760
Don't try to guess the teacher's mind.

743
00:23:33,760 --> 00:23:35,600
Students should
focus on their own duties.

744
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:38,560
You look different, Lin Yi.

745
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:40,800
Got your hair washed.

746
00:23:40,800 --> 00:23:41,640
Super Saiyan.

747
00:23:42,805 --> 00:23:43,874
(I think it's okay)

748
00:23:43,920 --> 00:23:44,560
Come on. Let's hype it up.

749
00:23:44,560 --> 00:23:45,520
Let's turn up, folks!

750
00:23:45,520 --> 00:23:46,520
No problem.

751
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:47,400
Come on.

752
00:23:48,040 --> 00:23:48,360
Let's do it.

753
00:23:48,360 --> 00:23:49,160
My hair is already soaked.

754
00:23:49,410 --> 00:23:51,024
(Fearless)

755
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:53,640
We can't even pass one song.

756
00:23:54,800 --> 00:23:55,680
First line together.

757
00:23:56,639 --> 00:23:59,531
♪On the banyan tree by the pond♪

758
00:23:59,531 --> 00:24:03,197
- ♪Cicadas are singing of summer♪
- Xingxu!

759
00:24:04,426 --> 00:24:07,236
♪On the swing by the playground♪

760
00:24:07,323 --> 00:24:10,839
(Always ready)
♪Only butterflies rest upon it♪

761
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:11,448
Gong Jun.

762
00:24:12,068 --> 00:24:14,868
♪Teacher's chalk on the blackboard♪

763
00:24:14,868 --> 00:24:18,995
♪Still chattering
and scribbling nonstop♪

764
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:19,600
Lin Yi.

765
00:24:20,810 --> 00:24:22,852
♪Waiting for class to end♪

766
00:24:22,852 --> 00:24:24,896
♪Waiting for school to dismiss♪

767
00:24:24,896 --> 00:24:27,680
♪Waiting for childhood playtime♪

768
00:24:27,680 --> 00:24:28,000
Yuning

769
00:24:28,748 --> 00:24:31,708
♪The welfare shop has everything♪

770
00:24:31,840 --> 00:24:35,400
- ♪But not a dime in my pocket♪
- Together!

771
00:24:37,002 --> 00:24:39,792
♪Zhuge Silang and the Devil Gang♪

772
00:24:39,898 --> 00:24:43,680
- ♪Who actually got the sword♪
- Together!

773
00:24:44,782 --> 00:24:47,668
♪That girl from the neighboring class♪

774
00:24:47,668 --> 00:24:52,195
♪Why hasn't she passed by my window♪

775
00:24:52,980 --> 00:24:57,084
♪Snacks in mouth, comics in hand♪

776
00:24:57,084 --> 00:25:00,643
♪First crush in childhood♪

777
00:25:00,760 --> 00:25:03,272
(Childhood challenge successful)

778
00:25:14,960 --> 00:25:16,880
That was so tough.

779
00:25:17,753 --> 00:25:19,120
The poor kid was about to cry.

780
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:20,560
So pitiful.

781
00:25:20,560 --> 00:25:22,560
Childhood is truly unforgettable.

782
00:25:27,800 --> 00:25:28,997
(Offense and defense switch)

783
00:25:29,640 --> 00:25:32,400
My feet can't take standing any longer.

784
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:33,960
I'm going to the hospital for an IV.

785
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:34,680
I'll go...

786
00:25:35,480 --> 00:25:36,560
No way, definitely not.

787
00:25:37,120 --> 00:25:38,160
You can't go alone, right?

788
00:25:38,160 --> 00:25:38,680
I...

789
00:25:38,680 --> 00:25:40,120
Let's go.

790
00:25:40,520 --> 00:25:41,160
Wipe your own front.

791
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:42,196
- I'll wipe your back.
- Okay.

792
00:25:42,302 --> 00:25:43,959
(Unwarranted kindness)

793
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:44,480
Let's go.

794
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:44,960
I have money here.

795
00:25:44,960 --> 00:25:45,640
I've got money on me.

796
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:46,120
Let's go.

797
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:47,800
What does it mean?

798
00:25:49,036 --> 00:25:50,179
(See through it and call it out)

799
00:25:50,480 --> 00:25:51,200
I mean I'm going to the hospital.

800
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:52,240
No, you can't.

801
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:52,640
(Stay right here)
Wait.

802
00:25:52,640 --> 00:25:53,080
Well...

803
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:57,520
Hello, Mr. Chen.

804
00:25:58,240 --> 00:26:00,640
I'm just a teacher.

805
00:26:00,800 --> 00:26:02,520
(Please spare me)
I didn't splash anyone.

806
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:04,560
♪Waiting for you after class♪

807
00:26:04,560 --> 00:26:05,080
♪Waiting for school to be out♪

808
00:26:05,080 --> 00:26:06,840
I'm just a conductor, right?

809
00:26:07,974 --> 00:26:08,960
(Super excited)

810
00:26:08,960 --> 00:26:10,200
Which song did we pick?

811
00:26:10,800 --> 00:26:11,120
I'm choosing now.

812
00:26:11,120 --> 00:26:12,200
Please, move up.

813
00:26:13,360 --> 00:26:14,560
How about

814
00:26:14,560 --> 00:26:15,640
A Ladle of Water in Winter?

815
00:26:15,760 --> 00:26:16,240
(Agreed)
Sounds good.

816
00:26:16,800 --> 00:26:17,880
We just have to memorize it by heart.

817
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:19,080
And it's really hard.

818
00:26:19,080 --> 00:26:19,680
(I object)

819
00:26:19,680 --> 00:26:20,440
We can do it.

820
00:26:21,560 --> 00:26:22,160
Exactly.

821
00:26:24,360 --> 00:26:25,480
Okay, A Fire in Winter.

822
00:26:25,480 --> 00:26:26,400
Fire it up!

823
00:26:26,400 --> 00:26:27,160
Fire it up. Come on.

824
00:26:27,880 --> 00:26:28,520
Come on.

825
00:26:28,520 --> 00:26:29,640
Bring up the lyrics.

826
00:26:31,280 --> 00:26:32,240
It's so long.

827
00:26:33,560 --> 00:26:34,120
Switch the song.

828
00:26:34,120 --> 00:26:34,640
Switch it.

829
00:26:35,520 --> 00:26:36,160
Switch it?

830
00:26:36,160 --> 00:26:37,560
After seeing the lyrics?

831
00:26:37,720 --> 00:26:38,440
No way.

832
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:41,120
Stop struggling. Just memorize it.

833
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:43,960
