1388
00:46:18,526 --> 00:46:20,257
(Making small talk: "Black pink")

1389
00:46:20,257 --> 00:46:21,257
Do you want to have hot pot?

1390
00:46:21,508 --> 00:46:22,718
(Abrupt topic switch)

1391
00:46:22,777 --> 00:46:23,697
Do you want to have hot pot?

1392
00:46:23,837 --> 00:46:25,217
(Never forget to scout the situation)

1393
00:46:25,217 --> 00:46:25,897
Yeah.

1394
00:46:26,577 --> 00:46:27,177
Well,

1395
00:46:27,279 --> 00:46:28,217
(Two very sneaky people)

1396
00:46:28,217 --> 00:46:29,097
here's the deal.

1397
00:46:29,577 --> 00:46:32,017
We need to make hot pot together,

1398
00:46:32,537 --> 00:46:34,137
eat it together,

1399
00:46:34,897 --> 00:46:36,817
and not let Nai find out.

1400
00:46:37,036 --> 00:46:39,153
(Can't let Nai find out?)

1401
00:46:39,687 --> 00:46:41,457
(What are these two doing?)

1402
00:46:41,457 --> 00:46:44,257
It's in the pavilion behind me.

1403
00:46:44,257 --> 00:46:45,497
Look now and see if you can spot it.

1404
00:46:45,497 --> 00:46:46,417
Don't let Nai see.

1405
00:46:46,506 --> 00:46:49,210
(Completely oblivious)

1406
00:46:49,697 --> 00:46:50,457
There are mosquitoes here.

1407
00:46:50,457 --> 00:46:51,257
(Clumsy cover-up)

1408
00:46:51,257 --> 00:46:52,017
Didn't see it.

1409
00:46:52,017 --> 00:46:52,817
(Pointing)

1410
00:46:52,817 --> 00:46:53,897
Turn around the corner from here.

1411
00:46:54,337 --> 00:46:55,657
There's a pavilion and a table.

1412
00:46:55,657 --> 00:46:56,297
What then?

1413
00:46:56,297 --> 00:46:57,337
(Sharp)
Let's go put the ingredients

1414
00:46:57,337 --> 00:46:58,537
into the pot first,

1415
00:46:58,937 --> 00:47:00,697
then come back
and quietly tell the others

1416
00:47:00,697 --> 00:47:01,337
to go eat one by one.

1417
00:47:01,337 --> 00:47:03,377
(If we both leave suddenly)
If both of us leave suddenly, won't it...

1418
00:47:03,857 --> 00:47:04,257
It's okay.

1419
00:47:04,257 --> 00:47:05,097
You two go together.

1420
00:47:05,657 --> 00:47:06,377
Go together?

1421
00:47:06,377 --> 00:47:07,337
You heard it?

1422
00:47:07,346 --> 00:47:09,131
(Plotting broadcasted live)

1423
00:47:09,313 --> 00:47:10,257
(The whole team heard it)

1424
00:47:10,257 --> 00:47:10,777
You heard it?

1425
00:47:10,777 --> 00:47:11,817
Go, you go together.

1426
00:47:11,817 --> 00:47:12,097
Okay.

1427
00:47:12,617 --> 00:47:13,777
Plotting out loud.

1428
00:47:13,951 --> 00:47:16,337
(Still unaware)

1429
00:47:16,337 --> 00:47:16,977
Where's the bathroom?

1430
00:47:16,977 --> 00:47:17,497
The bathroom is...

1431
00:47:18,617 --> 00:47:20,457
(Making an excuse to leave)
Yeah? The food was way too spicy.

1432
00:47:20,457 --> 00:47:20,777
Yeah.

1433
00:47:28,097 --> 00:47:28,457
Over here.

1434
00:47:28,937 --> 00:47:29,137
Yeah.

1435
00:47:29,777 --> 00:47:30,017
Okay.

1436
00:47:32,577 --> 00:47:33,457
The pot isn't boiling yet.

1437
00:47:33,457 --> 00:47:33,897
Well,

1438
00:47:33,897 --> 00:47:34,617
I don't think Nai

1439
00:47:34,617 --> 00:47:35,697
can notice it for now.

1440
00:47:41,457 --> 00:47:43,377
He's like a gorilla in the zoo.

1441
00:47:43,377 --> 00:47:44,097
(Observing humans)
Well,

1442
00:47:44,097 --> 00:47:46,257
he just stares intently
at whatever simple task you're doing.

1443
00:47:46,977 --> 00:47:48,337
Focus on your own task.

1444
00:47:48,937 --> 00:47:50,417
(Cucumber just peeled)
I'm waiting for this cutting board.

1445
00:47:50,417 --> 00:47:51,937
Actually, your cucumber
doesn't even need this.

1446
00:47:51,937 --> 00:47:53,657
(Cooking method updated)
How about we make smashed cucumber?

1447
00:47:53,657 --> 00:47:54,577
Okay, smashed cucumber works.

1448
00:47:54,937 --> 00:47:56,177
(Kitchen help rotation)
How to smash cucumber?

1449
00:47:56,177 --> 00:47:56,817
Cucumber.

1450
00:47:56,883 --> 00:47:58,753
(Leisurely)

1451
00:48:02,120 --> 00:48:04,182
(Two heads)

1452
00:48:05,217 --> 00:48:06,577
He spotted us.

1453
00:48:11,236 --> 00:48:13,096
(Locking eyes)

1454
00:48:14,784 --> 00:48:16,270
(Guo Jingfei)

1455
00:48:19,057 --> 00:48:19,577
Hurry.

1456
00:48:19,577 --> 00:48:20,017
You stay here.

1457
00:48:20,017 --> 00:48:20,977
He spotted us.

1458
00:48:20,977 --> 00:48:21,817
Put the ingredients in.

1459
00:48:22,977 --> 00:48:23,697
It's okay.

1460
00:48:23,697 --> 00:48:25,457
Well, no problem for Fei to come.

1461
00:48:27,337 --> 00:48:27,697
Stop!

1462
00:48:27,756 --> 00:48:30,388
(Panicking)

1463
00:48:31,937 --> 00:48:32,337
Bro.

1464
00:48:32,937 --> 00:48:34,577
Perfect timing.

1465
00:48:35,272 --> 00:48:35,777
(Holding tightly)

1466
00:48:35,777 --> 00:48:36,617
Keep it down.

1467
00:48:36,617 --> 00:48:37,697
There's big news.

1468
00:48:37,697 --> 00:48:38,257
Big news.

1469
00:48:38,697 --> 00:48:39,457
Well,

1470
00:48:39,457 --> 00:48:40,817
there's a mission.

1471
00:48:40,817 --> 00:48:42,377
The remaining eight of us

1472
00:48:42,377 --> 00:48:42,977
(Sneaky)
have to cook

1473
00:48:42,977 --> 00:48:43,577
the entire hot pot

1474
00:48:43,577 --> 00:48:44,537
@

1475
00:48:44,537 --> 00:48:45,457
and eat it all,

1476
00:48:45,457 --> 00:48:46,937
without letting Naiwen know.

1477
00:48:48,177 --> 00:48:48,777
For real?

1478
00:48:48,777 --> 00:48:49,377
Really.

1479
00:48:50,377 --> 00:48:51,497
You're on the other team.

1480
00:48:52,057 --> 00:48:53,137
Later, help me

1481
00:48:53,137 --> 00:48:54,497
tell the members of your team,

1482
00:48:54,497 --> 00:48:55,377
except Naiwen.

1483
00:48:55,617 --> 00:48:56,057
Alright.

1484
00:48:56,057 --> 00:48:57,497
Our teammates already know.

1485
00:48:57,497 --> 00:48:58,017
Okay.

1486
00:48:58,017 --> 00:48:58,537
(Recruited a new member)

1487
00:48:58,537 --> 00:48:58,817
Okay.

1488
00:48:59,137 --> 00:49:00,017
This is clear broth.

1489
00:49:00,142 --> 00:49:01,243
(The base hasn't been added yet)

1490
00:49:01,497 --> 00:49:02,577
Where's the hot pot soup base?

1491
00:49:05,603 --> 00:49:08,097
(All the hot pot soup base added)

1492
00:49:08,097 --> 00:49:10,137
Okay, I don't think Nai will notice now.

1493
00:49:12,443 --> 00:49:13,982
(Provocation)

1494
00:49:14,004 --> 00:49:16,355
(Focusing on sous-chef duties)

1495
00:49:16,657 --> 00:49:17,897
(Preparation for stir-fried beef complete)
Come on, let's cook.

1496
00:49:18,471 --> 00:49:20,224
(Stir-fry shredded beef
and then set aside)

1497
00:49:20,331 --> 00:49:21,537
(Stir-fry garlic, green pepper,
and doubanjiang)

1498
00:49:21,537 --> 00:49:22,897
Add some doubanjiang.

1499
00:49:22,897 --> 00:49:24,157
(Add the prepared beef back in)

1500
00:49:24,253 --> 00:49:26,217
(Season with chicken bouillon,
sugar, and soy sauce)

1501
00:49:26,217 --> 00:49:26,777
(Add celery and cilantro to stir-fry)
Smells wonderful!

1502
00:49:27,457 --> 00:49:28,257
Smells delicious.

1503
00:49:28,617 --> 00:49:29,377
Done.

1504
00:49:29,377 --> 00:49:29,897
Dish it out.

1505
00:49:29,897 --> 00:49:30,751
(Stir-fried beef is done)

1506
00:49:30,826 --> 00:49:32,696
(Chef He's Rice Wine Stewed Meat
returns)

1507
00:49:33,284 --> 00:49:35,122
(Add ginger slices)

1508
00:49:35,122 --> 00:49:37,099
(Add washed chicken pieces)

1509
00:49:37,132 --> 00:49:39,119
(Stir-fry with MSG, chicken bouillon,
and sugar)

1510
00:49:39,365 --> 00:49:41,439
(Pour in rice wine)

1511
00:49:42,697 --> 00:49:44,257
This one again.

1512
00:49:46,665 --> 00:49:48,407
(Back from the bathroom)

1513
00:49:48,931 --> 00:49:50,747
(Committing to the act)

1514
00:49:50,897 --> 00:49:52,017
I need to wash my hands.

1515
00:49:52,019 --> 00:49:53,337
(Back in batches)

1516
00:49:53,337 --> 00:49:53,817
Covered in mud.

1517
00:49:54,093 --> 00:49:56,337
(Exactly)

1518
00:49:56,337 --> 00:49:58,496
(Returning with a mission)

1519
00:49:58,870 --> 00:50:00,313
(Sniffing the dish)

1520
00:50:00,313 --> 00:50:01,531
(Now's the time)

1521
00:50:01,670 --> 00:50:02,577
(Dragging away)

1522
00:50:02,577 --> 00:50:03,257
What's up?

1523
00:50:03,257 --> 00:50:04,017
There's a mission.

1524
00:50:04,178 --> 00:50:05,328
Here's the deal:
there's a pot of food cooking,

1525
00:50:05,328 --> 00:50:05,860
and we have to finish it all,

1526
00:50:05,860 --> 00:50:06,737
without letting Li Naiwen find out.

1527
00:50:06,737 --> 00:50:07,817
(Li Naiwen)
Don't let Li Naiwen find out.

1528
00:50:07,817 --> 00:50:08,977
Did I add too little in?

1529
00:50:08,977 --> 00:50:09,377
Whose?

1530
00:50:09,377 --> 00:50:10,377
(Confused)

1531
00:50:10,377 --> 00:50:11,257
It's our mission.

1532
00:50:11,257 --> 00:50:11,857
(Plotting right in front of him)

1533
00:50:11,857 --> 00:50:12,097
Well...

1534
00:50:13,257 --> 00:50:13,937
What should we do?

1535
00:50:15,257 --> 00:50:15,617
What's wrong?

1536
00:50:15,895 --> 00:50:17,659
(Silence is golden)

1537
00:50:17,744 --> 00:50:21,805
(What does it mean, finish a pot
to complete the mission?)

1538
00:50:22,497 --> 00:50:23,457
Just cover it and let it simmer.

1539
00:50:23,569 --> 00:50:24,217
(Focusing on sous-chef duties)

1540
00:50:24,217 --> 00:50:24,857
Wait for it to boil.

1541
00:50:25,503 --> 00:50:28,303
(Yuwen's Scallion Braised Tofu goes in)

1542
00:50:28,657 --> 00:50:30,137
There are five minutes left.

1543
00:50:30,137 --> 00:50:31,897
(Simmer for five minutes to finish)

1544
00:50:31,897 --> 00:50:34,217
Cut a small guokui.

1545
00:50:36,857 --> 00:50:37,377
What do you want to do?

1546
00:50:37,377 --> 00:50:38,097
Making roujiamo?

1547
00:50:38,377 --> 00:50:39,377
No, making guokui.

1548
00:50:40,137 --> 00:50:40,777
Guokui?

1549
00:50:40,777 --> 00:50:41,857
Twice-cooked pork in guokui.

1550
00:50:42,710 --> 00:50:43,811
(Guokui?)

1551
00:50:44,762 --> 00:50:46,643
(Entering wandering mode)

1552
00:50:49,737 --> 00:50:50,337
What are you doing?

1553
00:50:51,538 --> 00:50:53,497
(Passing on mission intel)

1554
00:50:53,497 --> 00:50:53,937
What's up?

1555
00:50:53,937 --> 00:50:55,217
Do you know about this?

1556
00:50:55,217 --> 00:50:56,097
Know what?

1557
00:50:56,097 --> 00:50:56,857
You don't know it?

1558
00:50:58,737 --> 00:51:00,217
Look at that...

1559
00:51:01,857 --> 00:51:02,377
(What's wrong with this kid?)
This...

1560
00:51:03,057 --> 00:51:03,497
This knife...

1561
00:51:03,508 --> 00:51:04,857
(The familiar opening line)

1562
00:51:04,857 --> 00:51:05,297
Well...

1563
00:51:05,737 --> 00:51:06,217
The knife is quite nice.

1564
00:51:06,217 --> 00:51:06,977
(I'm playing along)
I mean...

1565
00:51:06,977 --> 00:51:08,617
We have a hot pot behind us.

1566
00:51:09,297 --> 00:51:09,897
Yuwen.

1567
00:51:13,017 --> 00:51:13,617
Your tofu...

1568
00:51:15,377 --> 00:51:15,897
You just leave it like that?

1569
00:51:15,970 --> 00:51:17,562
(Caring equally about every dish)

1570
00:51:17,754 --> 00:51:18,497
(Connection paused)

1571
00:51:18,497 --> 00:51:18,897
I forgot about it.

1572
00:51:20,116 --> 00:51:22,200
(What was I doing?
Didn't get caught, right?)

1573
00:51:22,977 --> 00:51:23,857
It needs to fry a bit longer.

1574
00:51:23,857 --> 00:51:25,337
Fry it until it's...

1575
00:51:32,657 --> 00:51:33,657
Go to the bathroom.

1576
00:51:35,100 --> 00:51:36,928
(Leading Nai away)

1577
00:51:37,708 --> 00:51:40,027
(Leaving it to you guys)

1578
00:51:40,594 --> 00:51:42,656
(Watching him leave)

1579
00:51:43,777 --> 00:51:44,977
(Connecting continues)
The eight of us...

1580
00:51:49,217 --> 00:51:49,777
You were whispering here.

1581
00:51:49,777 --> 00:51:50,777
What were you whispering about?

1582
00:51:51,257 --> 00:51:52,297
Whispering so much.

1583
00:51:53,377 --> 00:51:54,377
You pass the message to him.

1584
00:51:54,562 --> 00:51:56,657
(Shouldn't stay long)

1585
00:51:57,297 --> 00:51:58,057
You know it now?

1586
00:51:58,297 --> 00:51:58,817
I know.

1587
00:51:59,217 --> 00:51:59,697
Got it? Good.

1588
00:52:00,408 --> 00:52:01,977
(Diligently studying recipes)

1589
00:52:01,977 --> 00:52:03,297
We need to cook a hot pot.

1590
00:52:03,297 --> 00:52:03,657
This is...

1591
00:52:06,650 --> 00:52:08,499
(Constantly vigilant)

1592
00:52:08,737 --> 00:52:09,377
This is a secret.

1593
00:52:10,377 --> 00:52:10,857
A secret?

1594
00:52:11,577 --> 00:52:12,857
Why are you
so much taller than me today?

1595
00:52:14,377 --> 00:52:15,937
Are you standing on higher ground?

1596
00:52:15,937 --> 00:52:17,017
(Please keep it down)
It's a secret.

1597
00:52:17,017 --> 00:52:18,577
No, your shoes are too elevated.

1598
00:52:18,577 --> 00:52:19,857
You're already 6'3".
Is that really necessary?

1599
00:52:19,857 --> 00:52:20,377
Keep it down.

1600
00:52:20,977 --> 00:52:22,657
Naiwen can't find out.

1601
00:52:22,657 --> 00:52:23,577
I'm only talking loudly

1602
00:52:23,577 --> 00:52:24,497
because he's not here.

1603
00:52:25,192 --> 00:52:25,577
(Still very nervous)

1604
00:52:25,577 --> 00:52:26,577
I'm just worried he might be nearby.

1605
00:52:27,977 --> 00:52:28,857
Back there.

1606
00:52:28,857 --> 00:52:29,857
See that small pavilion?

1607
00:52:29,857 --> 00:52:30,377
Cook it up.

1608
00:52:30,857 --> 00:52:31,777
Cook all the ingredients.

1609
00:52:32,257 --> 00:52:32,777
Everyone...

1610
00:52:33,604 --> 00:52:34,662
(Returning)

1611
00:52:35,036 --> 00:52:36,104
(Back in position)

1612
00:52:36,158 --> 00:52:38,338
(Strolling casually)

1613
00:52:38,577 --> 00:52:39,537
Not ready yet?

1614
00:52:39,537 --> 00:52:40,817
It's not boiling yet, almost.

1615
00:52:40,817 --> 00:52:42,177
(Eager for pot to boil)
It's bubbling now.

1616
00:52:43,537 --> 00:52:44,217
Let me tell you.

1617
00:52:45,057 --> 00:52:46,337
Don't be sneaky.

1618
00:52:46,337 --> 00:52:48,057
We should be totally open.

1619
00:52:48,057 --> 00:52:49,097
Just sit right here and eat.

1620
00:52:49,271 --> 00:52:52,435
(Be confident)

1621
00:52:52,577 --> 00:52:53,737
Let's sit there and eat.

1622
00:52:54,337 --> 00:52:54,937
Looks cool that way.

1623
00:52:55,160 --> 00:52:57,629
(Dipping into hot pot in style)

1624
00:52:58,217 --> 00:52:58,737
(Someone even more confident)
Marinate for a bit.

1625
00:53:00,417 --> 00:53:01,297
I'll go get some minced garlic.

1626
00:53:01,297 --> 00:53:03,187
(No garlic in hot pot halves the joy)

1627
00:53:04,057 --> 00:53:05,137
What's the mission about?

1628
00:53:05,137 --> 00:53:05,817
Eat.

1629
00:53:05,817 --> 00:53:06,417
(Concise)
And then?

1630
00:53:06,417 --> 00:53:07,417
Don't let Naiwen find out.

1631
00:53:07,897 --> 00:53:08,577
(Strutting around)
Don't.

1632
00:53:08,897 --> 00:53:10,057
Don't let Nai see.

1633
00:53:10,057 --> 00:53:10,897
No one will see this.

1634
00:53:15,798 --> 00:53:17,839
(Suddenly looking back)

1635
00:53:19,624 --> 00:53:21,035
(Quick head duck)

1636
00:53:24,497 --> 00:53:25,417
(Creating distraction)
Can you make minced garlic?

1637
00:53:25,817 --> 00:53:26,297
I'm on it.

1638
00:53:26,297 --> 00:53:27,057
What a coincidence.

1639
00:53:27,057 --> 00:53:27,697
I'll make some minced garlic.

1640
00:53:27,697 --> 00:53:28,257
(Hot pot dips needed urgently)
Minced garlic.

1641
00:53:28,577 --> 00:53:28,897
Right.

1642
00:53:28,897 --> 00:53:29,217
I'll do it.

1643
00:53:30,034 --> 00:53:31,701
(Blocking vision from behind)

1644
00:53:31,786 --> 00:53:33,218
(Crisis averted)

1645
00:53:33,379 --> 00:53:34,939
(Sweating heavily)

1646
00:53:35,777 --> 00:53:37,737
In this situation, just give him

1647
00:53:37,737 --> 00:53:38,497
something to do.

1648
00:53:38,551 --> 00:53:38,897
(Already on it)

1649
00:53:38,897 --> 00:53:39,857
(Adding more)
You need to do some work at least.

1650
00:53:41,257 --> 00:53:42,057
I'm on it.

1651
00:53:42,057 --> 00:53:42,617
Right, okay.

1652
00:53:42,933 --> 00:53:45,177
(Focusing on mincing garlic)

1653
00:53:45,177 --> 00:53:45,737
What are you doing?

1654
00:53:45,737 --> 00:53:46,937
Minced garlic, right?

1655
00:53:47,377 --> 00:53:47,897
Right.

1656
00:53:50,897 --> 00:53:53,617
How about we teach you a dish
step by step?

1657
00:53:53,617 --> 00:53:55,057
Teach me a dish step by step?

1658
00:53:55,057 --> 00:53:55,937
Yeah, we'll tell you

1659
00:53:55,937 --> 00:53:57,177
what to do step by step.

1660
00:53:57,177 --> 00:53:57,657
Sure.

1661
00:53:57,657 --> 00:53:59,537
